        {
            category = "Class",
            channel = "live",
            classToken = "ROGUE",
            date = "2026-08-06",
            id = "change-51e0e749bb8202eb",
            localizations = {
                en = {
                    change = {
                        "Developers' notes: The changes to Outlaw in Curse of Ula'tek are intended to improve talent build diversity and flexibility. We've increased the power of some underperforming talents and pulled back some that could feel \"locked in\". Killing Spree's damage has been increased significantly because the damage it did wasn't sufficiently stronger than using other abilities during its channel would have been. The talent should now increase your overall damage about as much as other comparable talents.",
                        "Killing Spree has been updated – Duration no longer increases from spending combo points beyond your maximum. Each combo point spent beyond your maximum increases damage by 15%.",
                        "Adrenaline Rush now speeds up the execution of Killing Spree by 20%, the same rate it increases the speed of your other attacks.",
                        "Killing Spree prefers targets that are not immune to damage or taking less than 5% physical damage.",
                        "Killing Spree damage increased by 60%. Does not affect PvP combat.",
                        "Killing Spree shots have a higher chance to target your selected target if they're valid.: Developers’ notes: Much of Killing Spree’s value is the combo points it generates, so when players can spend more combo points on Killing Spree than their maximum, such as through Supercharger, the value of those extra points is diminished. Killing Spree’s duration now maxes out at the time required to generate maximum combo points, and any extra combo points spent increase the damage of the ability by a proportional amount.",
                        "Improved Between the Eyes has been updated – Causes Between the Eyes critical strikes to deal 2.5 times normal damage (was 3 times).",
                        "Fast Action has been updated – Now reduces the cooldown of Between the Eyes by 8 seconds (was 5 seconds) and increases the damage bonus from each Between the Eyes stack by 1%.",
                        "All damage increased by 9%. Does not affect PvP combat.",
                        "Heavy Hitter increases the damage of attacks that generate combo points by 15%/30% (was 10%/20%).",
                        "Zero In value per stack reduced to 2% (was 3%).: Developers' notes: We don't want players to feel obligated to use off-hand daggers to maximize the value of this talent. Zero In now has a 30% chance to not proc if triggered by a weapon with 1.8 Speed, giving it the same proc rate when attacking with daggers vs. other one-handed weapons.",
                        "Audacity now also increases Ambush damage by 80%.",
                        "Hidden Opportunity's chance for Ambush to grant Opportunity increased to 100% of the chance for Sinister Strike to grant Opportunity (was 80%).",
                        "Hidden Opportunity also reduces Ambush's Energy cost by 5.: Developers’ notes: Audacity and Hidden Opportunity are not as strong as other talent options, so we’re adding some effects to them to make them more competitive.",
                        "Summarily Dispatched increases Dispatch damage by 15%/30% (was 10%/20%).",
                        "New connectors have been added in the talent tree between Ruthlessness and Find an Opening, and between the Flickering Steel choice node and Grand Melee.",
                    },
                    name = "Rogue",
                    source = "Blizzard",
                    sourceUrl = "https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24293281/curse-of-ula-tek-content-update-notes#item16",
                    specialization = "Outlaw",
                    terminologySourceUrls = {},
                    translatedFrom = "",
                    translationType = "official",
                },
                zhTW = {
                    change = {
                        "開發者備忘錄：The 針對 Curse of Ula'tek 中 Outlaw 的改動旨在提升天賦構築的多樣性與靈活性。We've 提升了一些表現不佳的天賦的威力，並回調了一些可能會讓人感到「綁死」的天賦。Killing Spree's 的傷害已大幅提升，因為其造成的傷害並未顯著高於在其引導期間使用其他能力所能造成的傷害。現在，The 天賦應該能將你的整體傷害提升到與其他同等天賦差不多的水準。",
                        "Killing Spree 已更新——Duration不再因消耗超出最大上限的連擊點數而增加。消耗超過最大上限的每點Each連擊點數會使傷害提高15%。",
                        "Adrenaline Rush現在會加快Killing Spree的施放速度20%，其提升速率與你其他攻擊的速度相同。",
                        "Killing Spree會優先以不受傷害免疫或受到的物理傷害少於5%的目標為對象。",
                        "Killing Spree 的傷害提高 60%。Does 不影響 PvP 戰鬥。",
                        "Killing Spree shots have a higher chance to target your selected target if they're valid.: 開發者備忘錄：of Killing Spree’s 的很大一部分價值在於它產生的連擊點數，因此當玩家可以將超過上限的連擊點數花費在 Killing Spree 上（例如透過 Supercharger）時，這些額外點數的價值就會降低。Killing Spree’s 的持續時間現在最高上限為產生最大連擊點數所需的時間，且任何額外消耗的連擊點數都會按比例增加該技能的傷害。",
                        "Improved Between the Eyes已更新 – Causes Between the Eyes致命一擊現在造成正常傷害的2.5倍（原為3倍）。",
                        "Fast Action 已更新——現在使 Between the Eyes 的冷卻時間減少 8 秒（原為 5 秒），並使每個 Between the Eyes 層數帶來的傷害加成提高 1%。",
                        "所有傷害提高 9%。Does 不會影響 PvP 戰鬥。",
                        "Heavy Hitter使產生德魯伊/連擊點數的攻擊傷害提高15%/30%（原為10%/20%）。",
                        "Zero In value per stack reduced to 2% (was 3%。：開發者備註：我們不希望玩家覺得必須使用副手匕首來將這個天賦的價值發揮到極致。Zero In現在若由具備1.8 Speed的武器觸發，將有30%的機率不會觸發，使其在使用匕首與其他one手武器攻擊時具有相同的觸發率。",
                        "Audacity現在也會使Ambush傷害提高80%。",
                        "Hidden Opportunity's 使 Ambush 賦予 Opportunity 的機率提高至 Sinister Strike 賦予 Opportunity 機率的 100%（原為 80%）。",
                        "Hidden Opportunity also reduces Ambush's Energy cost by 5.: 開發者備忘錄：Audacity and Hidden Opportunity 的強度不如其他天賦選項，因此我們正在為其添加一些效果，以提升其競爭力。",
                        "Summarily Dispatched使Dispatch傷害提高15%/30%（原為10%/20%）。",
                        "New的連接線已在天賦樹中新增於Ruthlessness and Find與Opening之間，以及Flickering Steel抉擇節點與Grand Melee之間。",
                    },
