            classToken = "WARRIOR",
            date = "2026-08-06",
            id = "change-cfe342a2cf9f17bf",
            localizations = {
                en = {
                    change = {
                        "Developers' notes: Whirlwind has historically been a core part of Fury gameplay, even in single-target situations. We'd like to open the door for Whirlwind to be a useful ability in single target again.",
                        "New Talent: Carving Blades – Whirlwind deals 50% additional damage when it strikes only a single target.",
                        "Whirlwind has been updated – Whirlwind now generates 3 Rage innately.",
                        "Improved Whirlwind has been updated – No longer causes Whirlwind to generate 3 Rage innately, but still increases Rage generated by Whirlwind by 1 per target hit, up to 8 total Rage.",
                        "Rampaging Ruin has been redesigned – While Improved Whirlwind is active, Rampage's final strike slams the ground, dealing Physical damage to all enemies within 8 yards of your target. Damage reduced beyond 5 targets.: Developers' notes: Rampaging Ruin is intended to help alleviate the AOE target cap on Fury's rotational AOE abilities. The current design ended up being very difficult to figure out when it was best to use Rampaging Ruin, the new design should make the choice much more intuitive.",
                        "Hack and Slash has been updated – Rampage now has a 75% chance to refund a charge of Raging Blow and increase the damage of your next Raging Blow by 20%.: Developer’s notes: We feel that Fury plays best when there is a degree of uncertainty about which ability you’ll use after the one you’re currently pressing. Previous iterations of Hack and Slash provided extremely regular and consistent Raging Blow resets, causing Raging Blow to almost always be available. We believe this change will help keep Fury rotations variable and allow for more difference in rotational feel between builds that emphasize Raging Blow and those that do not.",
                        "Bloodbath initial damaged reduced by 12% and bleed damage increased by 300%.: Developers' notes: The intent behind Bloodbath is that the majority of the damage bonus comes from the bleed. The existing tuning hasn’t been delivering on that, so we’re moving some of Bloodbath’s increased damage from the initial hit to the bleed. This change should be net neutral for Bloodbath’s overall damage.",
                        "Hero Talents — Mountain Thane: Ground Current damage increased by 150%.",
                    },
                    name = "Warrior",
                    source = "Blizzard",
                    sourceUrl = "https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24293281/curse-of-ula-tek-content-update-notes#item16",
                    specialization = "Fury",
                    terminologySourceUrls = {},
                    translatedFrom = "",
                    translationType = "official",
                },
                zhTW = {
                    change = {
                        "開發者備忘錄：歷史上 Whirlwind 一直是 Fury 遊戲核心的一部分，即使在單體目標的情況下也是如此。我們希望為 Whirlwind 再次成為單體目標中的有用能力打開大門。",
                        "新天賦：Carving Blades – 當 Whirlwind 僅擊中單一目標時，會造成 50% 額外傷害。",
                        "Whirlwind已更新 – Whirlwind現在會天生產生3點Rage。",
                        "Improved Whirlwind已更新 – No不再使Whirlwind天生產生3點Rage，但每個受影響的目標仍會使Whirlwind產生的Rage提高1，總計最多提高8點Rage。",
                        "Rampaging Ruin has been redesigned – While Improved Whirlwind is active, Rampage's final strike slams the ground, dealing Physical damage to all enemies within 8 yards of your target. Damage reduced beyond 5 targets。：開發者備註：Rampaging Ruin旨在協助緩解Fury's循環AOE能力上的AOE目標上限。The目前的設計最終變得很難看出何時才是使用Rampaging Ruin的最佳時機，新設計應該會讓這個選擇直覺許多。",
                        "Hack and Slash has been updated – Rampage now has a 75% chance to refund a charge of Raging Blow and increase the damage of your next Raging Blow by 20%。：Developer’s備註：我們認為當你在使用當前按下的one之後，對於要使用哪個技能存在一定程度的不確定性時，Fury的遊玩體驗最好。Previous先前版本的Hack and Slash提供了極其規律且一致的Raging Blow重置，導致Raging Blow幾乎隨時可用。我們相信這項改動將有助於保持Fury循環的變化性，並允許強調Raging Blow的流派與沒有強調的流派在循環手感上有更多差異。",
                        "Bloodbath initial damaged reduced by 12% and bleed damage increased by 300%.: 開發者備忘錄：The 對於 Bloodbath 的設計意圖是大部分的傷害加成應來自於流血效果。The 現有的數值調整並未達到這個效果，因此我們將部分來自初始擊中的 Bloodbath’s 增加傷害轉移到流血效果上。此改動對 Bloodbath’s 的整體傷害應該是淨中立的。",
                        "Hero Talents — Mountain Thane：Ground Current傷害提高150%。",
