            category = "Class",
            channel = "live",
            classToken = "WARRIOR",
            date = "2026-08-06",
            id = "change-428f0b57e726ba1b",
            localizations = {
                en = {
                    change = {
                        "Devastating Focus has been updated – Now increases Revenge and Execute damage dealt to the target (was Revenge only).",
                        "Bloodborne has been updated – Now increases all Bleed damage (was only Rend and Deep Wounds).",
                        "Ravager has been updated –: Ravager damage increased by 50% and its duration is no longer reduced by Haste.",
                        "Ravager has been updated –: Ravager no longer increases Revenge and Thunder Clap damage while active. Ravager now causes all enemies it damages to take 50% increased damage from your Bleeds for 12 seconds. Duration reduced to 4 seconds with Whirling Blade.",
                        "Ravager has been updated –: Developers' notes: Ravager is a unique ability and we want the Ravager itself and its positioning to be important, but the current design puts more emphasis on its value as an AOE damage amp rather than the Ravager itself. We're redesigning Ravager slightly to address this, as well as to increase Ravager's value in all combat situations.",
                        "Revenge has been updated – Your successful dodges, parries, and auto-attacks have a chance to make your next Revenge cost no Rage (was only dodges and parries). Damage increased by 20%.: Developers' notes: Protection’s free Revenge counter-attack mechanic has existed for a long time, and we love it, but we don’t love how wildly its frequency and impact vary depending on what content you are doing. In dungeons, Revenge! triggers very frequently, contributing to many buttons being highlighted at once and overwhelming the rotation, but in raids and solo content, Revenge! frequency is so low as to feel weak and exacerbate Rage starvation issues. Our goal here is to shrink the gap between these extremes and make sure Revenge! procs feel meaningful while not crowding your rotation.",
                        "All ability damage increased by 11%.",
                        "Fueled by Violence heals you for 125% of Bleed damage dealt (was 110%).",
                        "Ignore Pain absorb amount increased by 25%.",
                        "Brutal Vitality adds 10% of damage dealt to Ignore Pain (was 8%).",
                        "Unyielding increases the damage reduction bonus of Defensive Stance by 6% (was 4%).",
                        "Hero Talents — Colossus: Practiced Strikes has been updated – Shield Slam generates an additional 4 Rage (was 3).",
                        "Hero Talents — Colossus: Tide of Battle increases the damage of Revenge and Execute (was Revenge only).",
                    },
                    name = "Warrior",
                    source = "Blizzard",
                    sourceUrl = "https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24293281/curse-of-ula-tek-content-update-notes#item16",
                    specialization = "Protection",
                    terminologySourceUrls = {},
                    translatedFrom = "",
                    translationType = "official",
                },
                zhTW = {
                    change = {
                        "Devastating Focus 已更新——現在使對目標造成的 Revenge and Execute 傷害提高（原僅限 Revenge）。",
                        "Bloodborne 已更新——現在提高所有 Bleed 傷害（原僅限 Rend and Deep Wounds）。",
                        "Ravager has been updated –：Ravager傷害提高50%，且其持續時間不再受Haste縮短。",
                        "Ravager has been updated –：Ravager在啟動時不再提高Revenge and Thunder Clap傷害。Ravager現在會使其傷害的所有敵人承受來自你Bleeds的傷害提高50%，持續12秒。透過Whirling Blade，Duration縮短至4秒。",
                        "Ravager has been updated –: 開發者備忘錄：Ravager 是一個獨特的技能，我們希望 Ravager 本身及其擺放位置非常重要，但目前的設計過於強調其作為 AOE 傷害增幅器的價值，而非 Ravager 本身。我們正在稍微重新設計 Ravager 以解決這個問題，並提高 Ravager's 在所有戰鬥情況下的價值。",
                        "Revenge has been updated – Your successful dodges, parries, and auto-attacks have a chance to make your next Revenge cost no Rage (was only dodges and parries). Damage increased by 20%。：開發者備忘錄：Protection’s免費的Revenge反擊機制已經存在很長一段時間了，我們很喜歡它，但我們不喜歡它的觸發頻率和影響力會根據你所進行的內容而有如此巨大的差異。In地城中，Revenge！的觸發非常頻繁，導致許多按鈕同時亮起並讓循環變得過於繁雜，但在團隊副本和單人內容中，Revenge！的頻率卻低到讓人感覺很弱，並且加劇了Rage資源匱乏的問題。Our此處的目標是縮小這些極端情況之間的差距，確保Revenge！的觸發感覺有意義，同時又不會擠壓你的循環。",
                        "所有能力傷害提高 11%。",
